          "expr": "ml_platform_check_state{check=\"forecast_horizon\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Whether the production forecast model can still describe a future instant. ML.FORECAST projects from the end of *training* data, so a model can return confident numbers about a window that closed months ago. FAIL here is exactly that condition."
    },
